    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1296">

                <pb facs="0885" n="769" xml:id="pg769"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/43.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Davis to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guadalajara</hi>
                        </placeName> (<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1914-01-14T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1914-01-12T00:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date><hi rendition="#italic">; received January 14,
                            1914</hi>).</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Legislature State of Michoacan has decreed a forced loan equalling one year
                    taxes to support federal troops in that state claiming the money will be
                    returned. Several Americans here owning property in that state want to know if
                    they have to comply.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
